    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +2, ATK 321%{passiveImg:up_g} and DEF 123%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Medium chance of performing a critical hit\n- Damage reduction rate 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- All allies' ATK 40%{passiveImg:up_g}, plus an additional ATK 30%{passiveImg:up_g} for 2 turns\nfor characters who also belong to the \"DAIMA\" Category\n*Per \"DAIMA\" Category ally attacking in the same turn*\n- ATK & DEF 123%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of performing a critical hit 10%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For 4 turns from the character's entry turn*\n- Chance of performing a critical hit 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Interrupts the attacked enemy\n*Starting from the 5th turn from the character's entry turn*\n- {passiveImg:once}Ki +12\n- ATK 123%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Medium chance of interrupting the attacked enemy\n*When attacking*\n- ATK & DEF 123%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking as the 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- ATK & DEF 123%{passiveImg:up_g} and launches an additional Super Attack\nfor 7 turns\n*When there is a \"Dragon Ball Seekers\" or \"DAIMA\" Category enemy*\n- ATK & DEF 123%{passiveImg:up_g}",
